# Per-gauge NHD/NWPS cache. The loose dir (700+ small JSON files) is
# untracked — commit data-cache/gauges.tar.gz instead via `pnpm data:cache:pack`.
# build-waterways-data.mjs unpacks the tarball on startup if the loose dir
# is missing, so a fresh clone or Docker build gets the cache for free.
data-cache/gauges/

